id: btl_interface_bootloadinfo_single
label: Bootload Info Interface Single (Series-3)
package: bootloader
description: >
  The bootloader interface bootloadinfo single component part of bootloader application interface. It provides common functionality for storage. This component provides
  the bootloader with multiple storage options. All implementations provide a slot-based API to
  access image files to be bootloaded.
category: Platform|Bootloader
quality: production
source:
- path: platform/bootloader/series3/storage/bootloadinfo/btl_storage_bootloadinfo_single.c
include:
- path: platform/bootloader/series3/storage/bootloadinfo
  file_list:
  - path: btl_storage_bootloadinfo.h
provides:
- name: btl_interface_bootloadinfo_single
requires:
- name: btl_crc
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: MSLA
root_path: bootloader
